<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-01T21:18:42.489Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 21:18:42 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistan’s security forces have responded to unprovoked fire from Afghan Taliban posts in South Waziristan, killing a civilian and wounding five, and have also carried out operations against illegal Afghans in Peshawar. Taliban fighters clashed with Pakistani forces in Paktika, leaving three dead and injured. In Balochistan, a woman suffered burns in an acid attack by her brother-in-law and tribal protests erupted after gunmen killed three people. The conflict has caused 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE9qVjFna053OEp2bnVMQlVlTjJkOVZiRHZ5NUZQWGRmZGNiNm9pdnlqcVFOSjkwMkxNM3Zkb09tY2UyUmNIMHNYcQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1OdHMtcHpzNXVfdHlwdFhQUVlRaDFMTTBCM3NRLW5KMjRidUFCTmNEb09hUk1DRzdublZkVEoxanNndGo4a1ZaaA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxPWDdRWmxHUGJPelNNUjBDekkyVzZKRmtWbklnMzNfcVQ3SGt6ZkRvOUlsWVRaLWNqRTltUmlsVTA3ZElROS1NdnRzdnpEbEJTSXd4Z3kyci1pM2FKSHA3SjZzY3Qtd2ZUX01HRmhyU24wRkxYeVlTYTNyY1dHZ3dmUkItWklEQlRzNUdQU2ZEREt2VHhnelNEVzVaM1B5VmlxSl9wQWhMOGdkRWl3aTFIcVdsVnJJTDVnUTY4TXZMNGo?oc=5&quot;&gt;The News Pakistan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxPeFUzdWprSjBjUnN3RE5FVk16S3hwSEc3NFFSaWRKbGVVdlQ2WUIxOEw5RkVqR01mR2JIeE1SdUZYWTNfU250SnFtR3JkZGlvQ0Rfc0lON0ZndTZoQ2ZVVmpMbm9nQzJnY05qSUt0eUd5Wmg2UDVRTW9rbU1kWG41QkpMbHRPRENyWXVXcVRyNGhEWEg2VzZaNkZSSFdMdms?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNbWZXa1FpX2ZjUDE3Y2hiS2ZYMEtoTE1hSHNDeGR6dE03Y0FXbklwQ2JHZVRCeUhqQUFobWUxeUhqQ0lXVmJLdTJ4eW93ZnQyNXhYc3ZWbzA0UE1yajJxNnY2